    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Clear pricing. Aftercare and follow-up included.\",\"title\":\"Circumcision Prices\",\"lede\":\"Clear circumcision prices for babies, children, teenagers and adults at Beverley Clinic in North-West London.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Prices\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Babies\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003efrom £200\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Children\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003efrom £300\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Adults\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003efrom £680\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our prices include the procedure, local anaesthetic, preparation and aftercare information, next-day follow-up call and follow-up appointments during healing where required.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book online</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">Contact us</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"babies-children-teenagers\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"babies-children-teenagers\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Babies, Children \\u0026 Teenagers\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/price-table {\"rows\":[{\"name\":\"0–2 months\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£200\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=0 to 2 months\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"3–5 months\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£230\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=3 to 5 months\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"6–11 months\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£250\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=6 to 11 months\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"1–2 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£280\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=1 to 2 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"3–5 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£300\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=3 to 5 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"6–9 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£330\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=6 to 9 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"10–11 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£360\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=10 to 11 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"12–13 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£400\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=12 to 13 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"14–15 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£530\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=14 to 15 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"},{\"name\":\"16–17 years\",\"desc\":\"\",\"price\":\"£630\",\"href\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=16 to 17 years\",\"cta\":\"Book this\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"28px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Children with a medical or foreskin problem:</strong> Please contact us for an individual quote.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book baby circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book child / teenage circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"adult-circumcision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"adult-circumcision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Adult Circumcision\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Adult circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003e£680\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor adult circumcision where there is no medical or foreskin problem.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=Adult circumcision, no medical or foreskin problem\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Adult circumcision with frenulum treatment\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003e£880\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor circumcision where a short or tight frenulum also requires treatment during the procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=Adult circumcision with removal of the frenulum\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Adult circumcision for a medical or foreskin problem\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022cil-price-amount\\u0022\\u003e£1,080\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor circumcision where there is a medical or foreskin problem such as phimosis, significant scarring or BXO / lichen sclerosis, with or without treatment of the frenulum.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/?for=Adult circumcision with a medical or foreskin problem\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"quoted-individually\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"quoted-individually\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Quoted Individually\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Children with a medical or foreskin problem\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe procedure required can vary depending on the condition and anatomy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for a quote.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Contact us\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Re-circumcision and circumcision revision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eEvery previous circumcision is different. We therefore usually need to assess the existing circumcision before advising what further procedure is appropriate.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for a quote.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn about re-circumcision\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/re-circumcision/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"iv-sedation\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"iv-sedation\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"IV Sedation\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"IV sedation may be available for particularly nervous patients and must be arranged in advance.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"cil-price-amount\"} --><p class=\"cil-price-amount\">Additional £800</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please contact the clinic before booking if you would like to discuss sedation.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">Contact us</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"what-is-included\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"what-is-included\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"What Is Included?\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We want our pricing to be clear so that patients and parents know what is included in their care.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your circumcision price includes:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"cil-checklist\"} --><ul class=\"cil-checklist wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Circumcision procedure</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Local anaesthetic</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Preparation information</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Written aftercare information</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Aftercare guidance</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Next-day follow-up call</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Follow-up appointments during healing where required</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>GP letter where required</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Nursery, school or work letter where required</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our support does not finish when the procedure is completed. If you have questions or concerns during healing, you can contact us for advice and follow-up.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\">Watch our aftercare videos</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Specialist focus\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision is a core part of our day-to-day clinical work, rather than an occasional procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience in circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in circumcision techniques and patient care.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"All ages\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe technique used is selected according to the patient\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy, reason for circumcision and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Continuity of care\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur care does not end when you leave the clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents receive preparation information before treatment, detailed written aftercare afterwards, a next-day follow-up call and support throughout the healing period.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Trusted by patients and parents\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eMuch of our work comes through word-of-mouth recommendations from previous patients and families.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe also regularly see families return to us for another child or recommend Beverley Clinic to friends and relatives.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Thousands of patient reviews\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe have received thousands of reviews from patients and parents who have used our service.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou can read about their experiences on Google, Trustpilot and Yell.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read patient reviews\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/testimonials/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Convenient North-West London location\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBeverley Clinic is located in Edgware, North-West London, with good public transport links and plenty of free street parking nearby.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Get directions\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026query=78%20Beverley%20Drive%2C%20Edgware%20HA8%205NE\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"not-sure-which-price\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"not-sure-which-price\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Not Sure Which Price Applies?\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"If you are unsure which category applies, please contact us.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell us the patient's age and reason for circumcision, and we can advise you about the appropriate appointment.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This is particularly important if there is:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"cil-checklist\"} --><ul class=\"cil-checklist wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A medical or foreskin problem</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A previous circumcision</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A tight or short frenulum</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A request for circumcision revision</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A need for IV sedation</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book online</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">Contact us</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->",
    "seo": {
        "document_title": "Circumcision Prices London | Baby, Child & Adult Costs",
        "meta_description": "View circumcision prices at Beverley Clinic in London for babies, children, teenagers and adults. Baby circumcision from £200 and adult circumcision from £680."
    }
}
